1
00:00:00,278 --> 00:00:01,578
(Lucy(by text):)Sorry, auto-correct.

2
00:00:01,746 --> 00:00:04,946
That was supposed to say "I like sports."

3
00:00:08,386 --> 00:00:11,286
(Leonard:)I never wanted to play the cello.

4
00:00:12,924 --> 00:00:15,394
(Leonard:)How do you meet girls playing the cello?

5
00:00:15,560 --> 00:00:18,760
"Hey, wanna come over to my house
and hear me play an instrument...

6
00:00:18,930 --> 00:00:21,190
...that sounds like a suicidal bumblebee?"

7
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:25,630
(Howard:)Quick, pull the fire alarm,
let's get out of here.

8
00:00:26,104 --> 00:00:28,264
(Sheldon:)Uh, hello again. Um...

9
00:00:28,440 --> 00:00:31,470
(Sheldon:)Yeah, I don't know if women in general...

10
00:00:31,643 --> 00:00:35,303
(Sheldon:)...have been actively discouraged
from pursuing the sciences...

11
00:00:35,480 --> 00:00:39,710
(Sheldon:)...but it's clear you young women
here today have been.

12
00:00:44,155 --> 00:00:47,185
(Sheldon:)While I was listening to my colleagues
waste your time...

13
00:00:47,359 --> 00:00:50,919
(Sheldon:)...it occurred to me that it might be
much more meaningful...

14
00:00:51,096 --> 00:00:55,536
(Sheldon:)...to hear about women in science
from actual women in science.

15
00:00:55,734 --> 00:00:58,764
(Sheldon:)And, uh, I happen to know
two brilliant examples...

